  "description": "Mir’s dull life is turned upside down when a stranded alien who can only recharge through physical touch arrives out of the blue. Hoping a little out-of-this-world excitement might shake things up, Mir agrees to help, expecting nothing more than a temporary, no-strings fling. But as casual intimacy blossoms into genuine affection, a heartbreaking reality sets in: the alien has a planet to return to. Can their love truly transcend worlds, or are they headed for a breakup measured in light-years? \n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
